    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>KANADE</strong>&quot; is a visual novel planned and penned by Asou Ei, with character designs and illustrations by Yusano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the romantic story of two former pen pals as they experience their first love in a world that is gradually approaching its demise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;KANADE&quot; features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A script planned and written by the prolific Asou Ei (&quot;euphoria,&quot; &quot;Kuroinu,&quot; and &quot;Sakura no Uta&quot; ), who previously penned &quot;Lilja and Natsuka: Painting Lies&quot; with Frontwing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that is accessible for new visual novel players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs and illustrations by Yusano, who had also worked on &quot;ATRI -My Dear Moments-&quot; and &quot;GINKA&quot; among other games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroine voiced by Yuko Natsuyoshi (Rio, &quot;Shine Post&quot; anime; Yuyu, &quot;Assault Lily&quot; anime), who also sings the opening theme of the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack by industry veteran Fuminori Matsumoto (&quot;Wonderful Everyday Down the Rabbit-Hole&quot;).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opening theme with lyrics by Yoshikazu Kuwashima, known for his work on vocal tracks for the &quot;Grisaia&quot; series.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1920x1080 resolution support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/401c63021e4470cee2911585822bfebf.poster.avif?t=1749691257\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/401c63021e4470cee2911585822bfebf.webm?t=1749691257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanade (VA: Yuko Natsuyoshi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A half-human, half-alien girl who loves to sing. She hopes to save the world through song in place of her alien mother, who isn't there to do it anymore. Honest, kind-hearted, and always polite, she puts her all into everything she does. However, her unfamiliarity with Earth as a half-alien sometimes shows itself in ways that surprise those around her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, a sudden proliferation of plants has left much of human civilization drowning in greenery. Yuuto is a boy living in a city that's now largely reclaimed by nature. One day, a girl named Kanade appears on his doorstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two had been exchanging letters after she found one of his carrier pigeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I have to sing the greatest love song and save the world in my mother's place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, Yuuto-san... Would you please fall in love with me?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warmly watched over by those around them, the two tentatively begin their exploration of love. What neither of them realize is that a spark of affection has already budded between them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall in love, make music, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of a wondrous future where the encounter between a boy and girl brings a miracle to the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>KANADE</strong>&quot; is a visual novel planned and penned by Asou Ei, with character designs and illustrations by Yusano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the romantic story of two former pen pals as they experience their first love in a world that is gradually approaching its demise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;KANADE&quot; features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A script planned and written by the prolific Asou Ei (&quot;euphoria,&quot; &quot;Kuroinu,&quot; and &quot;Sakura no Uta&quot; ), who previously penned &quot;Lilja and Natsuka: Painting Lies&quot; with Frontwing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that is accessible for new visual novel players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs and illustrations by Yusano, who had also worked on &quot;ATRI -My Dear Moments-&quot; and &quot;GINKA&quot; among other games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroine voiced by Yuko Natsuyoshi (Rio, &quot;Shine Post&quot; anime; Yuyu, &quot;Assault Lily&quot; anime), who also sings the opening theme of the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack by industry veteran Fuminori Matsumoto (&quot;Wonderful Everyday Down the Rabbit-Hole&quot;).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opening theme with lyrics by Yoshikazu Kuwashima, known for his work on vocal tracks for the &quot;Grisaia&quot; series.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1920x1080 resolution support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/401c63021e4470cee2911585822bfebf.poster.avif?t=1749691257\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104270/extras/401c63021e4470cee2911585822bfebf.webm?t=1749691257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanade (VA: Yuko Natsuyoshi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A half-human, half-alien girl who loves to sing. She hopes to save the world through song in place of her alien mother, who isn't there to do it anymore. Honest, kind-hearted, and always polite, she puts her all into everything she does. However, her unfamiliarity with Earth as a half-alien sometimes shows itself in ways that surprise those around her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, a sudden proliferation of plants has left much of human civilization drowning in greenery. Yuuto is a boy living in a city that's now largely reclaimed by nature. One day, a girl named Kanade appears on his doorstep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two had been exchanging letters after she found one of his carrier pigeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I have to sing the greatest love song and save the world in my mother's place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, Yuuto-san... Would you please fall in love with me?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warmly watched over by those around them, the two tentatively begin their exploration of love. What neither of them realize is that a spark of affection has already budded between them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall in love, make music, and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of a wondrous future where the encounter between a boy and girl brings a miracle to the world.</p>",
    "short_description": "A visual novel about becoming lovers with Kanade\u2014a half-human, half-alien girl. Enjoy a tender relationship with Kanade and witness how love blossoms into a song that saves the world.",
